title: C: vi.mock("@/billing") stands in for ../src/billing, which the base side's root tsconfig.json maps @/* to
origin: #196 188.6 (ruling 2026-10-03): C, the base-side root tsconfig's paths and baseUrl, routed through the one module_key
=== head: tsconfig.json ===
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "baseUrl": ".",
    // the project's own source root
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["src/*"],
